    "body": "## Parent\n\n#172\n\n## What to build\n\nMigrate unhandled values to pending Action Items, dismissed values to dismissed history, and locally Done values to completed native Tasks while preserving old Run files.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Unhandled legacy action values become pending Action Items with stable identities.\n- [ ] Dismissed legacy values become dismissed Action Item history.\n- [ ] Locally Done values without provider receipts become completed canonical Tasks linked to promoted Action Items.\n- [ ] Old Run files remain unchanged and readable.\n- [ ] Migration is atomic, idempotent, restart-safe, and resumes safely from partial prior work.\n- [ ] Repeated migration creates no duplicate Task or Action Item.\n- [ ] `npm run check` is green.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #176 — Trash, restore, and permanently delete Tasks\n- #179 — Dismiss, restore, and regenerate Action Items safely\n- #182 — Make Meeting Debrief email-only and non-expiring",
